{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"DHI-tsep-wy52-o7ni-ou7d","published":"2026-11-11T18:51:34Z","modified":"2026-11-24T15:15:07.140291922Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-1933"],"summary":"A flaw was found in Samba’s handling of NTFS-style reparse points on shares configured with read only = yes. Due to…","details":"A flaw was found in Samba’s handling of NTFS-style reparse points on shares configured with read only = yes. Due to missing SMB-layer access checks, authenticated users with underlying filesystem write permissions may create or delete reparse point metadata through SMB operations even on read-only exports. This could allow modification of SMB-visible file behavior, including converting files into symbolic links or other reparse point types.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"samba","ecosystem":"Docker Hardened Images:Alpine:3.23","purl":"pkg:apk/dhi/samba"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"4.22.6-r0"}]}],"versions":["4.22.10-r0","4.22.10-r1","4.22.6-r0","4.22.8-r0"],"database_specific":{"owner_kind":"HSP","source":"https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/advisories/blob/main/dhi/osv/2026/DHI-tsep-wy52-o7ni-ou7d.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://scout.docker.com/v/DHI-tsep-wy52-o7ni-ou7d"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-1933"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://bugzilla.samba.org/show_bug.cgi?id=15992"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2447317"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-1933"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://errata.almalinux.org/8/ALSA-2026-22644.html"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:22644"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://errata.almalinux.org/9/ALSA-2026-25049.html"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:25049"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://security.alpinelinux.org/vuln/CVE-2026-1933"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://securit